  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Slot</strong> none; <strong>Price</strong> 5,000 gp (lesser), 10,000 gp (normal), 20,000 gp (greater)<br>\n<strong>Weight</strong> 5 lbs.; <strong>Feat Cost</strong> 1 sp</p>\n<p>When you cast a piercing talent against a target with spell resistance, it treats the spell resistance of the target as 5 lower than its actual spell resistance.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Apparatus, Piercing Spell; <strong>Cost</strong> 2,500 gp (lesser), 5,000 gp (normal), 10,000 gp (greater)</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/apparatuses-metamagic#toc38\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": "<p>Selected profile: lesser tier; held slender rod. Use as part of casting a qualifying sphere effect while holding this apparatus in at least one hand. The effect must be caster level seven or lower. Spend one of 3 daily uses; only one metamagic apparatus may apply per casting. Its feat’s extra spell-point and casting-time costs are waived, but normal effect and other-metamagic costs still apply.</p><p>Treat only the selected target’s spell resistance as five lower against this talent. Do not reduce its actual resistance for other effects or modify general magic skill checks.</p><p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/apparatuses-metamagic\">Shared metamagic apparatus rules</a>. Feat Cost applies to taking the feat, not using the physical apparatus.</p>",
      "unidentified": ""
    },
